/Title (In seconds, in front of the executive committee, an artificial intelligence tool analyses a 50-page report, extracts the strategic issues and drafts a summary ready for distribution. The execution is lightning-fast. The result is impressive. The conclusion seems obvious: a process that used to take your teams hours has been reduced to a single click. The promise of a huge return on investment \(ROI\) is on the table.)
